# =====================================================================================
# EVERY DIRECTORY PATTERN HERE IS EITHER ANCHORED OR MARKED `# any-depth`
# =====================================================================================
#
# ⚠ THIS FILE HAS NOW GOT ANCHORING WRONG TWICE, IN OPPOSITE DIRECTIONS.
#
#   Task 0, bug 1: `/build/` was anchored to the repository root, so `apps/api/build/` --
#   the PHPStan tmpDir -- was committed, 678 cache files. Fixed by UNANCHORING it. `PLAN.md`
#   records it as "do not repeat".
#
#   Task 8a: `storage/` was UNANCHORED, so it also matched `apps/api/storage/`. The root
#   `storage/` is the workspace gate's log directory; `apps/api/storage/` is Laravel's, with
#   its own tracked `.gitignore` files inside it, and a new file written there would have
#   been silently unaddable.
#
# `§7`: *"Never fix the same bug twice. If it recurs, the regression test was missing."* So
# this gets the GUARD and not just the anchor -- `tools/gate/test/gitignore.test.mjs`, which
# fails if any directory pattern is unanchored without the marker, and fails if a marker is
# applied to a pattern that does not need one.
#
# THE MARKER IS THE INTENT, WRITTEN WHERE THE PATTERN IS. "Anchored as intended" is not
# something a checker can infer -- both of the bugs above were a correct pattern for one
# reading of the intent -- so the intent is declared beside each pattern and the checker
# holds the declaration to the tree.

.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.log
.DS_Store

# any-depth: the PHPStan tmpDir is `apps/api/build`, which is exactly what Task 0's
# anchored `/build/` missed. This one must match below the root.
build/

# any-depth: pnpm with `hoist=false` puts a node_modules in EVERY package, not only the
# root -- four of them in this tree today.
node_modules/

# any-depth: an editor directory appears wherever the editor was opened, including inside
# a vendored dependency.
.idea/
.vscode/

# ---------------------------------------- the frontend workspace (Task 8a, ADR-003)

# Anchored: pnpm's content-addressable store is configured once, at the root.
/.pnpm-store/

# Anchored: one coverage run, one directory, written by the root vitest config.
/coverage/

# any-depth: `next build` writes into each app -- apps/web/.next and apps/site/.next.
.next/
out/

*.tsbuildinfo

# Anchored: Playwright's reporters are configured at the root and write there.
/test-results/
/playwright-report/
/blob-report/

# ⚠ ANCHORED, AND THE ANCHOR IS THE FIX. Unanchored, this also matched
# `apps/api/storage/` -- Laravel's, which carries tracked `.gitignore` files of its own.
# The root `storage/` is the workspace gate's log directory, the sibling of
# `apps/api/storage/logs`.
/storage/

# The planted TS2345 the root-project typecheck proof writes and removes
# (tools/gate/test/typecheck-coverage.test.mjs). Ignored so a crashed run cannot leave an
# untracked file that reddens CI's clean-tree assertion instead of the thing under test.
/browser/planted-type-error.generated.ts
